<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-005" chapter-id="c-liangshu-005-ruanlingying-annals" source-id="s-liangshu-005-ruanlingying-annals-ws2312810">
  <p id="c-liangshu-005-ruanlingying-annals:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">世祖孝元皇帝諱<persName id="c-liangshu-005-ruanlingying-annals:p001:m0007" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w">繹</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-005-ruanlingying-annals:p001:m0010" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w">世誠</persName>，小字<persName id="c-liangshu-005-ruanlingying-annals:p001:m0015" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w">七符</persName>，高祖第七子也。天監七年八月丁巳生。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-005-ruanlingying-annals:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">追尊所生妣<persName id="c-liangshu-005-ruanlingying-annals:p002:m0005" ref="8dg_6jb_3j5_A">阮脩容</persName>爲文宣太后。</p>
</text>
